    <h2>Privacy statement</h2>
    <h3>Security & Privacy</h3><br />
    We are bound by the National Privacy Principles set out in the Commonwealth of Australia Privacy Act 1988, and are fully committed to complying with those principles.<br /><br />
    Patient's medical details and all dispensed prescriptions recorded in our internal computer are private and confidential to the patient only and cannot be accessed by any third party (except in circumstances required by law). Each time we dispense a prescription, we are required by the National Health Act and relevant State/Territory Pharmacy legislation, to collect and hold details about the customer concerned. These details are also used to warn of possible drug interactions and adverse drug reactions and ensure safe usage and delivery of medicines to the patient. In addition, we need to record our customers purchase details to be able to issue receipts, refunds, etc.<br /><br />
    If required, you have the right to access the personal information that we may hold about you. Speak to one of our Customer Service team members.<br /><br />
    Your activities and purchases are private and secure and no information is shared with 3rd parties.<br /><br />
    When checking out, all information is secured with SSL encryption. Credit card details are validated by our payment gateway and then discarded. No credit card numbers are stored by us.<br /><br />
    If you have any concerns about privacy issues, please do not hesitate to contact us and outline your concerns, so we can address them as soon as possible.
    <h3>Shipping and Handling Delivery Information</h3><br />
    We use Australia Post or a courier service for all deliveries. Please allow 2-7 workings days for delivery. <br /><br />
    Orders will be delivered to the provided address and may require a signature on receipt.<br /><br />
    Please note that if the item is delivered by Australia Post or by a courier service the parcel cannot be left unattended. Where no one is available to sign for the parcel, a card will be left either detailing the nearest Australia Post outlet where the parcel can be collected, or our courier will leave a note to arrange another drop off time.<br /><br />
    If you have any special instructions for the delivery driver, please leave details in the comments section of the checkout. <br />
    A contact phone number may be left on the parcel for the delivery driver to contact you if there is no one home to sign for the parcel. If you do not want your phone number displayed please leave a comment in the comments section of the checkout.<br />
    <h3>Delivery Charges Within Australia</h3><br />
    Up to 3kg:  $9.95<br /><br />
    Over 3kg: If your order is over 3kg, we will require the standard shipping payment of $9.95 at time of purchase. Before we process your order we will contact you with the extra cost of shipping to arrange payment.
    <h3>Delivery Charges Overseas</h3><br />
    Up to 1kg: $58.00<br />
    Over 1kg: If your order is over 1kg, we will require the standard shipping payment of $58.00 at time of purchase. Before we process your order we will contact you with the extra cost of shipping to arrange payment.
    <h3>ORDERS CONTAINING A PRESCRIPTION </h3><br />
    Prescriptions on our website are flagged as "INSTORE ONLY"<br />
    <h3>Estimated Delivery Times</h3><br />
    Please allow 2-7 working days for all orders to be processed and shipped.<br /><br />
    If there is a delay with your order our staff will contact you to provide you with the relevant details and advise when this stock will be delivered out to you.<br /><br />
    If at any time you have any concerns or questions about your order please contact one of our staff on (08) 9458 3677 (8am-7pm Mon-Fri  WST)<br />
    <h3>Payment Method</h3>
    <h4>Credit Card or with PayPal:</h4><br />
    We accept all major credit cards including, Visa and MasterCard. We do not accept American Express (AMEX) or Diners card. There is no surcharge for using your credit card to pay for your purchases.<br /><br />
    Please be sure to provide your exact address and telephone. Incorrect information may cause a delay in processing your order. Your credit card will be billed as soon as your order is placed. This is done to protect the security of your credit card details, as we do not store your card details at any point. In the event that we cannot fulfil your order or some items cannot be shipped, we will refund the difference back to your credit card.<br /><br />
    Why we use PayPal because it is faster, safer, and easier online shopping.<br /><br />
    All prices are listing in Australian dollars (AUD).<br /><br />
    All prices listed are inclusive of GST. A tax invoice will arrive with your goods.<br />
